  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• In a medium saucepan, bring the water (for the rice) to the boil. Add the basmati rice, stir, cover with a lid and reduce the heat to low. Cook for 10 minutes, then remove the pan from the heat and keep covered until the rice is tender and the water is absorbed, 10 minutes.\n• TIP: The rice will finish cooking in its own steam so don't peek!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/5e30da2fe03a532f866050ae/step-52dcfa56.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "While the rice is cooking, thinly slice the zucchini and carrot (unpeeled) into half-moons. Roughly chop the tomato. Roughly chop the Asian greens. Finely grate the ginger. Finely grate the garlic (or use a garlic press). Drain and rinse the chickpeas.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/5e30da2fe03a532f866050ae/step-291fc1ff.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over a medium-high heat. Add the ginger and garlic and cook until fragrant, 1 minute. Add the tandoori paste, Mumbai spice blend and tomato paste and cook, stirring, until fragrant, 1 minute. Add the zucchini, carrot, tomato, chickpeas and water (for the curry) and stir to combine. Simmer until the veggies have softened, 3-4 minutes. Add the light thickened cream, brown sugar and the salt to the frying pan. Simmer until combined, 4-5 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/5e30da2fe03a532f866050ae/step-995c7efd.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "While the curry is simmering, pick and finely chop the mint leaves. In a small bowl, combine the mint, Greek yoghurt and a pinch of salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/5e30da2fe03a532f866050ae/step-2d706352.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the Asian greens to the curry and stir until wilted, 2 minutes. Season to taste with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/5e30da2fe03a532f866050ae/step-ea9a746e.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Divide the basmati rice between bowls and top with the Indian chickpea curry. Top with a dollop of mint yoghurt to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/5e30da2fe03a532f866050ae/step-8f70fe25.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
